um-ma ru-ba-um u ru-ba-tum-ma sa tup-pa-am qa-at-ni u-ka-lzt ku-nu-ti u-ta-ma-ku-nu a-wi-lam ru-a-nim su-ma fQ ta-ra-di-a-ni-su I ma-na a-mu-tam u-la I 0 ma-na KU.GI di-na-nim-ma a-hu-ku-nulu-se-er su-ma lata-da-na Ia ta-tu-ra-ma su-um-su Ia ta-za-ka-ra a-hu-ku-nu me-et.,"The king and queen replied: 'Since our hand holds the letter it is yourselves whom I will make swear your oath. Bring us that man. If you do not lead him here then give us one mina of amiitum or ten minas of gold so I may release your brother. If you do not pay up, then do not return and do not to mention his name again. Your brother will be dead'.","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Anatolia in the Old Assyrian Colony Period. CNIP 38, 2011.pdf",321
