KÙ.BABBAR šu-a-tí a-na ITU.KAM ša-qá-lam qá-bi4-a-tí ki-ma ITU.KAM ta-li-ku 3 ITU.KAM ú 4 ITU.KAM i-Té-ga-ra-ma ta-ta-ša-áb a-na Kà-ni-iš ta-li-kà-ma KÙ.BABBAR e-ri-iš-ma ú-lá ta-ta-dí-nam ta-áp-nu-a-ma um-ma a-ta-ma a-hi a-ta lá-li-ik a-dí Ha-tim lá-ak-šu-ud ha-ra-nam iš-té-et KÙ.BABBAR-áp-kà lá-áb-el.,"You promised to pay this money back in one month. Instead of 1 month, you surely went (away and) you have stayed in Tegarama for 3-4 months. You came to Kaneš, and I demanded the money, but you did not give it (back). You appealed to me, saying: ‘Dear brother, let me leave for Hattum. Let me have the use of your money for one more journey’","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",144
a-hu-a a-tù-nu šu-ma a-ma-kam ta-le-e-a am-tám! ú ṣú-úh-ra-am ma-lá ta-le-e-a-ni šu-ul!-ha-ni-im a-dí KÙ.BABBAR 10 GÍN gu5-um-ra-ma a-na Té-ga-ra-ma ú Ha-tim šé-bi-lá-ni-ší šu-ma ma-ṣa-ra-tum da-na-ma a-na ú-ṣa-im lá na-ṭú ú-ṭa-tim ša ša-na-at šu-up-kà-ší-im ṣú-ha-ru a-na Lu-hu-za-tí-a li-ik-šu-du-ni.,"Dear brothers, if it is possible for you there, dispatch the slave-girl and the children, as you are able. Make an arrangement of some 10 shekels of silver and have her brought to Tegarama or Hattum. If the guard posts are strong, and it is not feasible to set out, then measure out grain to (supply) her for one year. The servants should reach me in Luhuzattiya.","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",144
i-na Té-ga-ra-ma wa-áš-⌈ba⌉-ku ... i-na dUTU-ši ṭup-pí ta-ša-me-a-ni A-lá-hu-um lu a-na Hu-ra-ma lu a-na Ku-ša-ra a-na ṣé-ri-a li-li-kam.,"I am staying in Tegarama … On the day you hear my letter, Ali-ahum should come and meet me in either Hurama or in Kuššara.","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",144
