um-ma a-ta-ma a-na 10 ⌈u4⌉-[me] iš-tù Ku-ša-ra ú-ul iš-tù Ša-mu-ha [ú-šé-ba-lá-kum] šu-ma lá [ú-šé-bi4-lá-kum] šu-ša-a[l-šu-um a-ša-qá-al].,"You said: ‘Within ten days, [I will send it to you] from either Kuššara or from Šamuha. If I do not [send it, I will pay you the] trip[le]’.","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",164
