sí-kà-tum da-na,The sikkātum is fierce.,"Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",49
a-dí tù-wa-ar kà-ni-ší-im ra-ma-kà ša-ṣé-er la té-ra-ba-am,"Take care of yourself, and do not enter until the return of the Kanešite (king).","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",49
