ki-ma dIM-ba-ni ù dUTU-ub-lam a-na Ha-na-ak-na-ak e-ru-bu-ni i-na É kà-ri-im iṣ-bu-tù-šu-nu,"When Adad-bani and Šamaš-ublam entered Hanaknak, they seized them in the Office of the Colony","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",290
