ta-áš-pu-ra-am um-ma a-ta-ma ha-ra-ni a-na a-limki et-qá-ni-ma [a-w]a-at-ku-nu [da-n]a-a a-bu-ni [a-ta] ki-ma [a-w]a-tum a-ma-kam [d]a-na-ni-ma ṣa-ah-ru-um a-ri-ni-iš lá e-ra-ba-ni ù a-na-nu-um a-na-kam lu-qú-tum ša ha-ra-an sú-qí-nim i-ṣí-ib-tù-ni a-ší-a-tí da-ni-ša-ma a-na e-ra-bi4-im ni-ip-ta-lá-ah a-bu-ni a-ta a-wa-tum ša É.GAL-lim li-id-mi-qá-ma i-na SIG5-tim a-ri-ni-iš lu!? n[é-ru-ub].,"You wrote, saying: ‘I am going to the City. Travel over – your (pl.) messages are strict’. Our dear father, given that the orders are strict there, that a junior cannot enter ... , and that also goods, which were on the Narrow Track here, have been seized here, for that reason we are very anxious about entering (the track). Our dear father, when the orders of the palace soften, and the ... , then we will e[nter].","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",196
a-wa-at kà-ri-im da-na a-dì-i pá-zu-ur-ti-kà ša ta-áš-pu-ra-ni lá na-ṭù-ma a-dì-i pá-zu-ur-ti-kà lá ni-ša-pá-ra-kum.,"‘Since the orders of the Colony are strict, your (idea of) smuggling that you wrote to us about is not possible. Therefore we will not write about your smuggling’","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",196
