ma-ṣa-ra-tum! da-na a-na Lu-hu-za-ti-a Hu-ra-ma Ša-lá-ah-šu-a a-na ma-ti-ša a-dì ša pá-zu-ur-tim ru-ba-tum ta-áš-pur-ma e-na-tum na-ad-a a-pu-tum mì-ma lá tù-pá-za-ar šu-ma a-na Ti-me-el-ki-a te9-ti-qám a-ší-a-kà ša tù-šé-ta-qá-ni i-na be-tim SIG5 i-na Ti-me-el-ki-a e-zi-ib-ma.,"The guard posts are strong. The queen has written to Luhuzattiya, Hurama, Šalahšuwa and her own country about the smuggling, and ‘eyes’ have been posted. Urgent! Do not smuggle anything. In case you already travelled to Timelkiya, then you should leave the ašium-metal of yours, which you brought, in a safe house in Timelkiya ...","Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",190
