i-na Ni-na-ša-a 15 MA.NA URUDU ag-mu-ur,15 minas of copper in Ninašša.,"Barjamovic, Gojko - A Historical Geography of Ancient Anatolia in the Assyrian Colony Period. CNI 38, 2011.pdf",336
