"abi atta <béli> atta ramakka la tafaggif u yati la tasaggisanni abi atta béli atta istuma assumi Hannan-narim ina pim u lisanim fa taniftim pe""damgim ana salahika aturu iftitma arnam u fillatim ifu'akkunni minam aqabbi.","As you are my father and lord — do not murder yourself and do not murder me! As you are my father and lord —since I am supposed to have become as one who smears you with the talk and rumours from no-good people because of the affair of Hannan-narum, and since I am supposed to have only sin and crime for you— then what can I say?","Dercksen, J.G. et al. - Veenhof Anniversary Volume. PIHANS 89, 2001.pdf",145
