"misfu sa taqbi'u ana Alahim u Kurara umma attama tuppusu pe""fa himtatim istanapparam ayyam tuppi sa himtatim aspurakkunnima tukallissu kunuksuma ana fa kima kuwati sébilamma ... luba'isisni ul fa kima yati ammakam kallimma luba'ifisni","Why do you say as follows to Alâhum and Kurara: ""Does he not constantly send me his angry letter?"" Whichever angry letter from me that I sent you and you have in your possession, seal that and send it to your own representatives .. so they can disgrace me! Or show them there to my representatives, so they may disgrace me!","Dercksen, J.G. et al. - Veenhof Anniversary Volume. PIHANS 89, 2001.pdf",144
