a-na u4-um : e tà ri im et-ra-ni : É a-bi-a i-a-[a]m! ù e-ta-me É a-bi-a : e-té-er,"Save me while there is still time! Save my father's house, myself, and the spirits of my father's house!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",192
"a-di-i sa Ku-lu-ma-a sa ta-Cd-pu-mi-Mi, a-ma-la na-pé-er-ti-kà . qâ-[t]àm, la ni-ma-ha-as ù la nu-ba-âs-kà","Regarding what you wrote about Kulumâya, in accordance with your letter, we shall not reject (him), nor shall we embarrass you!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",192
ù u4-mu-su 3 sa-na-tim lu e-ta-a[t-qû],"Yet, his terms have been exceeded for 3 years!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",192
"ù d-th ûs-û-ni : e-té-me, [É a-but-ni lu a-qâ-li-ils-ma, [ù] ni-a-ti : a-na sa-hu-ru-tim, [lu is-ku-ni-a-ti]-ma","But since he left, he has discredited the spirits [of] our [fath]er's [house, and] us, [he has treated us] as 'small (people)'!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",192
"I. isti harranim, ittasâm u A. u K., isti ba ti qé e ittas'iinim, luqfitum ittas'akkum","I. has now left with the caravan, and A. and K. with the batigfi, the merchandise has now left for you","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",114
suhâram ibattaqamma usebbalam,I will let a servant bring it right away (or: separately),"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",114
"gitti URUDU-kà û kà ! an ma a-li-ku, ibassi istisunu usebbalakkum",I will secure the rest of the copper and if there are alikiù I will send it to you with them,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",206
"Kama âlika[m], la isû A-, akla alikam, ammarma kasapka, A- usebbalam","Since I have no alikum (available), I retained A., but when I see (find) one, I will let A. bring you the silver","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",206
