"saptam, sanniqama : kunkama, S.: isti a li ki<im> panîmma, tahhiasuma lillikam",Check and seal the wool and let S. join the next âliku(m) and come here (with it),"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",110
ilini u etemmti abbéni littula,May our gods and the spirits of our ancestors be witnesses.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"A-sùr, dMAR.TU-um û e-té-mu-û sa a-bé-a, li-tù-lk-ni lâ a sâ li ir kà ni","May Assur, Amurrum and the spirits of my ancestors be witnesses (that) I have not lied to you!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"DINGIR"" a-be-ni û e-ta-mu a-be-ni, li-tù-la : sa u4-ma-am e pu-su-ma",May the gods of our ancestors and the spirits of our ancestors be witnesses of the way I act today!,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"a-na-ku : a-na dA-sùr, DINGIR ""(1) a-be-ni : ù e-ta-me-e a-be-ni, it ku-nu-ti : ki-tam","As for me, for Assur, the gods of our ancestors and the spirits of our ancestors, as well as for you, I hold the truth.","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"mi-na-ami, e pu-us-kà : i-lu-um, lu i-de 8-e : û e-ta-mu, lu i-de 8-z","What have I done to you? The god is my witness, the spirits are my witnesses!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"a-na-kam sa-i-la-tim, ba-ri-a-tim ù e-té-me, nu-sa-al-ma, A-sùr us-ta-na-ad-kà, KU.BABBAR ta-ra-am, na pa-as-ta-kà, ta-ze-ar i-na, a lim é' A sùr ma-ga-ra-am, fi-la ta-le-e, a-pu-turn ki-ma tup pa-am, ta-às-me-z al-kam-ma, e-en A-sùr : a-mu-ur-ma, na pa-as-ta-kà e-té-er","Here, we consult the dream-interpreters, the diviners and the spirits; the god Assur does not cease to warn you: you love silver and despise your life! Can you not please the god Assur in the City? Please, as soon as you have heard this tablet, come, see the eye of Assur and save your life!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",103
"mi-na-ami, e pu-us-kà : i-lu-um, lu i-de 8-e : û e-ta-mu, lu i-de 8-z","What have I then done to you? The god is my witness, the spirits are my witnesses (that I have done nothing wrong)!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",194
"a-na-kam sa-i-la-tim, ba-ri-a-tim ù e-té-me, nu-sa-al-ma, A-sùr us-ta-na-ad-/kà, KU.BABBAR ta-ra-am, na pa-as-ta-kà, ta!(ZA)-ze-ar i-na, a lim é' A sùr ma-ga-ra-/am, fi-la ta-le-e, a-pu-turn ki-ma tup pa-am, ta-às-me-z al-kam-ma, e-en A-sùr : a-mu-ur-ma, na pa-as-ta-kà 17e-té-er","Here (at Aggur), we consult the dream-interpreters, the diviners and the spirits; the god Assur does not cease to warn you: you love (too much) money and despise your life! Can you not please the god Assur in the City (of Aggur)? Please, as soon as you have read (this) letter, come, visit the god Assur and save your life!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",194
"a-na qû-bu -ur Pu-zu -ur, um-mi-su-nu, a-na gam-ri-im ù hu-bu-ul, Pu-zu-ru um mi su nu , I di istàr i-za-az.","Iddin-Istar is responsible for the tomb of Puzur, their mother, for the expenses and the debt of Puzur, their mother.","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",188
"É sa Kà ni is, Ébe-er Hi-na-a, sa a-sar 115-ba-ni, na-lu-ni.","The house of Kanig, the house of Hinnaya where Ili-bâni is buried (lit. lying down).","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",188
a-hu-um a-na a-hi-im : la i-tù-ar,One shall not return to the other.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",58
a i-tù-ru : 5 ma-na KÙ.BABBAR i sa qal : û i-na i-ti-nim i-du-ku-su,Whoever returns shall pay 5 minas of silver and they shall execute him publicly.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",58
"a-na-ku, a-na É a-bi4-ni : ù e-té-me-su, ù-da-ma-aq-ma",I act for the best for the house of our father and for his spirits.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",102
"ma-la KU.BABBAR, i-na qé-tì-kà : ma-aq-tù : le-qé-a-ma, is-ti KU.BABBAR : al-kam-ma : e-té-me, a-bi-ni ù pu-û-ut É a-bi-ni, za-ki-ma : lu su-um-kà : sa-li-um, i-sé-er É a-bi-ni : la i-sa-lâ",Take all the silver that might fall into your hands and come with (this) silver; free (from all obligation) the spirits of our ancestors and 'the front of the house' of our father because your reputation is at stake! A malicious man must not act badly towards the house of our father.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",102
a-na u4-um : e tà ri im et-ra-ni : É a-bi-a i-a-[a]m! ù e-ta-me É a-bi-a : e-té-er,"Save me while there is still time! Save the house of my father, myself and the spirits of the house of my father!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",102
"a-di-i sa Ku-lu-ma-a sa ta-áš-pu-ru-ni, a-ma-la na-áš-pé-er-ti-kà, qâ-tàm, la ni-ma-ha-as ù la nu-ba-âs-kà, ù u4-mu-su 3 sa-na-tim lu e-ta-at-qû, ù iš-tù ūṣûni : e-té-me, [É a-bi-ni] lu a-qâ-li-il5-ma, [ù] ni-a-ti : a-na sa-hu-ru-tim, [lu iš-ku-ni-a-ti]-ma","Concerning what you wrote about Kulumâya, in accordance with your letter, we will not reject (him) nor will we embarrass you! However, his terms have been exceeded for 3 years! Since he left, he has discredited the spirits [of the house of] our father, [and] ourselves, [he treated us] as 'small (people)'!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",102
alikir adi (mala u) sinisu illikunim,alikir have arrived here several times,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",209
