"sa ta-ni-is-tim fi-la a-sa-me, sa A-Kir DINGIR/"" : a=bi4-ni û e-ta-mu a-bi4-ni ih li qir ni ma.","I do not want to listen to (what) the people (say), because Ashur, the gods of our fathers and the spirits of our ancestors have ruined me!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",196
