"a-su-mi KU.BABBAR sa ik-ri-bi4, a-na-kam Bé-la-turn, ta-am-ra-as i-na û-th-/ki, ù i-na e-ta-me, sa-am-th-al (ZA)-ni ... a-su-mi ma-za-zi-im, DINGIR lam-ni-is É a-bi4-ni, e pa-as-","Here, Belatum is sick because of the silver of the ikribu-offerings! We are maltreated by the demons and the spirits of the dead! (...) Because of the divine pedestal, the god is treating our father's house badly!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",196
"a-su-mi [KÙ].BABBAR, ik-ri-bi4 sa a-bi4-ni, Be-la-turn a-na-kam, ta-am-ra-as, ù i-na û-tù-ki, ù i-na e-ta-me, sa-am-th-a-ni a-ma-kam, a-na Pu-su-ke-en 6 pu-nu-a-ma, AN.NA ù TÙGb°-r' : a-ma-lé, i-le e ir : li-di-ma, KU.BABBAR li-ik-nu-uk-ma, lu sé bi 4 la ma na pa-érs-ta-ak-nu, ù na per ors ti ni, li-té-er a-na-kam, lam-ni-is : i-lu-um, É a-bi4-ku-nu : e pa-as.","Because of the silver, ikribu-offerings of our father, here, Belatum is sick, and we are maltreated by the demons and by the spirits of the dead! There, turn to Pusu-ken so that he may sell all the tin and all the fabrics he can, seal the silver and send it to save your lives and our lives! Here, the god is treating your father's house badly!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",196
si-im-térm 90 pc -ra-kà-ni-kà le -qi-a-ti,the fixed number of your 90 parakannum-textiles you have now received.,"Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008 (2).pdf",34
