su-ma [a-h]i a-ta : sa ma-ma-an : sa pi-im ù li-sa-nim : lâ ta-sa-me [dA] sùr dNIN.SUBUR i-l[i --ni [ù] e-té-mu a-bi-ni [li-tù-la] [su-ma] lâ ku-a-ti : ma-[nam] i-su -a : la i-. . . ù a-na [pi]-im ù li [S]a nim : lâ a-[sa-me] [ù] a-ta : sa ma-ma-an : là ta-sa-[m]e,"If you (are) my brother, you must not listen to the slanders and gossip of anyone. May Aggur, Ilabrat, our gods and the spirits of our fathers be witnesses, if not you, who else do I have? Now I should not listen to slanders and gossip, so you, you must not listen to anyone!","Michel, Cecile ed. - Old Assyrian Studies in Memory of Paul Garelli. PIHANS 112, 2008.pdf",193
