šu-ma [a-h]i a-ta : ša ma-ma-an : ša pí-im ù li-ša-nim : lá ta-ša-me [dA]-šùr dNIN.ŠUBUR i-l[i]-ni [ù] e-té-mu a-bi-ni [li-tù-la] [šu-ma] lá ku-a-tí : ma-[nam] [ša-n]i-a-am : lá i-šu-ú ù a-na [pí]-im ù li-[š]a-nim : lá a-[ša-me] [ù] a-ta : ša ma-ma-an : lá ta-ša-[m]e,"If you are my brother, you must not listen to the slanders and gossip of anyone. May Aššur, Ilabrat, our gods and the spirits of our fathers be witnesses, if not you, who else do I have? Since I should not listen to slanders and gossip, you then must not listen to anyone!",Michel_2008_Les Assyr. et les Esprits de Leurs Morts.pdf,12
