"a-na-kam ša-i-lá-tim, ba-ri-a-tim ù e-té-me, nu-ša-al-ma, A-šùr uš-ta-na-ad-/kà, KÙ.BABBAR ta-ra-am, na-pá-aš-ta-kà, ta!(ZA)-ze-ar i-na, a-limki A-šùr ma-ga-ra-/am, ú-lá ta-le-e, a-pu-tum ki-ma tup-pá-am, ta-áš-me-ú al-kam-ma, e-en A-šùr : a-mu-ur-ma, na-pá-áš-ta-kà e-té-er.","Here (in Assur), we consult the dream interpreters, the female diviners and the spirits; the god Assur does not cease to warn you: you love (too much) silver and despise your life! Can you not please the god Assur in the City (of Assur)? Please, as soon as you have heard (this) tablet, come, visit the god Assur and save your life!",Michel_2008_Les Assyr. et les Esprits de Leurs Morts.pdf,13
"a-dí-i ša Ku-lu-ma-a ša ta-áš-pu-ra-/ni, a-ma-la na-áš-pé-er-tí-kà : qá-[t]ám, la ni-ma-ha-as ù la nu-ba-áš-kà, ù u4-mu-šu 3 ša-na-tim lu e-ta-a[t-nqú], ù iš-tù ús-ú-ni : e-té-me, [É a-b]i-ni lu ú-qá-li-il5-ma, [ù] ni-a-tí : a-na sa-hu-ru-tim, [lu iš-ku-ni-a-tí]-ma.","Regarding what you wrote about Kulumāya, in accordance with your letter, we will not reject (him) nor will we embarrass you! However, his terms have been passed for 3 years! Now, since he left, he has discredited the spirits [of the house of] our father, [and] ourselves, [he has treated us] as 'little (people)'!",Michel_2008_Les Assyr. et les Esprits de Leurs Morts.pdf,11
